1
00:00:43,284 --> 00:00:46,758
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,758 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 21=

3
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,040
Excuse me, check this out.

4
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,480
- This...
- Nice nails.

5
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,983
Thanks.

6
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,436
Take a look, too.

7
00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,920
Excuse me.

8
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,090
Excuse me, Miss.

9
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:02,600
What's your name?

10
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,080
- I'm Xia Na.
- Here's the thing.

11
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:07,513
Let me introduce myself.

12
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,760
I'm the director
of Xingyao Model Agency.

13
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,960
My surname is Li.

14
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,000
You caught my eye

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,360
at the school gate just now.

16
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:15,400
Honestly, your looks and vibe

17
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,800
are simply stunning.

18
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:17,944
With your potential,

19
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,920
you're a natural-born star.

20
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,080
Really?

21
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,680
- Me?
- Absolutely.

22
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,960
Here's the thing. Our agency

23
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,920
is recruiting
a new batch of young idols.

24
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,560
With your looks,

25
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,651
give it three years

26
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,400
and you'll be landing ads

27
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,600
- and making it on TV.
- She's not interested.

28
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:38,520
Sorry, Miss.

29
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,520
I'm discussing something important
with Xia Na.

30
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:41,969
Please don't interrupt.

31
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,006
Important?

32
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,280
Shall I give everyone a rundown

33
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:47,360
of how Xingyao builds its stars?

34
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,400
Make empty promises first,

35
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,360
selling impossible dreams of fame.

36
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,120
Then trap them into signing

37
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,720
slave contracts with sky-high penalties.

38
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:54,760
And then what?

39
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,560
Force them into debt
for surgery and hosting,

40
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,560
shelve them indefinitely
if they don't land gigs,

41
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,160
and milk every last drop

42
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,200
until buried in debt.

43
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,440
Xiaotang, what are you saying?

44
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,760
- I...
- Come on.

45
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,197
Everyone, look at this.

46
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:11,328
This is how toxic
the competition is nowadays.

47
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,621
Little girl,

48
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,160
you work for our rival, right?

49
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,400
How much were you paid to slander us?

50
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,960
Yeah, Xiaotang.
You've never even been there.

51
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,080
You can't say that.

52
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,920
Don't make me call the cops on you.

53
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,462
Go ahead. Call them.

54
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,880
Let the police investigate

55
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,400
what happened to the trainee,

56
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,040
the one who was overworked last year

57
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,094
and had a dispute.

58
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,920
Stop talking nonsense!

59
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,640
Xia Na, he's no talent scout.

60
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,280
If you sign that contract,

61
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,680
your life will be ruined.

62
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,520
Wait, Xia Na.

63
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:49,000
- Let's talk.
- Why don't you scout me instead?

64
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,600
Take a good look at me.

65
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:52,160
- Take a good look, okay?
- Come with me.

66
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,520
- Xia Na.
- Gu Xiaotang, let go!

67
00:02:55,820 --> 00:02:57,760
Are you crazy?
Do you know what you're doing?

68
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:58,800
Xia Na,

69
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,280
we'd rather turn it down.

70
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,000
If you sign the contract,

71
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,480
you'll become a money-making puppet.

72
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,600
You'll lose your freedom.

73
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,360
Aren't we best friends?

74
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,960
I don't want you to get conned.

75
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,160
Best friends?

76
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,080
How can you say that
with a straight face?

77
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,720
Ever since you got close to Ye Shen,

78
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:20,200
have you even cared about me?

79
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,920
Don't you think you're being ridiculous?

80
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,664
- Xia Na...
- I don't even know what I did wrong

81
00:03:26,664 --> 00:03:28,000
for you to treat me like this!

82
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,480
Just stay out of my business
from now on.

83
00:03:43,326 --> 00:03:45,955
(Live towards the sun, cherish the time)

84
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,080
All right, class dismissed.

85
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,320
(Best friends...)

86
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,243
(How could I forget?)

87
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,440
(Before everything got so complicated,)

88
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:01,240
(we used to trust each other so much.)

89
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,558
Don't.

90
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,960
Did you fight with Xia Na today?

91
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,554
Ye Shen,

92
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,480
I had a nightmare.

93
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,320
Excuse me, Miss. Sorry to bother you.

94
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:38,000
I'm the director
of Xingyao Model Agency.

95
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,200
My surname is Li.

96
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:40,237
Here's the thing.

97
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:42,440
You caught my attention
just by the school gate.

98
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,775
(In my dream,)

99
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,089
(that director today)

100
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,440
(didn't hand the card to Xia Na,)

101
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,477
(but to me.)

102
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,800
(I became a model
against my family's wishes,)

103
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,400
(and that wasn't all.)

104
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:56,000
(I even introduced
my best friend, Xia Na,)

105
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,880
(to that director.)

106
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:03,120
(I thought we could support each other)

107
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,400
(and make a name for ourselves.)

108
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,520
(But later,)

109
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,720
(the agency's exploitation,)

110
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,120
(the fight for resources,)

111
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,480
(and human greed)

112
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:12,960
(changed us gradually.)

113
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,880
(We went from being best friends)

114
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,480
(to jealous,)

115
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,160
(scheming enemies,)

116
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:20,400
(and ended up
completely tearing each other apart.)

117
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,360
That's why I'm scared.

118
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,400
I'm scared that it will come true.

119
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,120
I'm scared that my choices

120
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,120
make her go down the same path.

121
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:33,482
I distanced myself from her
because of that nightmare, too.

122
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,175
She was just so terrifying in it.

123
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,120
But I forgot...

124
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:41,241
I forgot that the present her

125
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,680
has done nothing wrong to me.

126
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,408
Since you foresaw it,

127
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,880
you can surely change it.

128
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,928
Xia Na.

129
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,760
I saw everything just now.

130
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,640
- Xiaotang is...
- Stay away from me.

131
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,600
She's way out of line.

132
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,040
If you ask me,

133
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,640
she's just jealous of you.

134
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,640
What's it to you?

135
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,720
Nothing really.

136
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,720
But look. Lately,

137
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:21,000
her grades suddenly improved,

138
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,120
and she's acting all secretive.

139
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,520
I heard

140
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,680
she even got involved
with some shady crowd.

141
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,880
Her whole vibe changed.

142
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:28,880
If you ask me,

143
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:32,240
she probably found a better backer.

144
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,720
So she looks down on us.

145
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,030
She's just afraid

146
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:38,800
you'll make it before she does.

147
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,133
Na,

148
00:06:43,539 --> 00:06:46,040
opportunities are in your own hands.

149
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,760
That director seemed pretty legit.

150
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,011
It's a big agency.

151
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,320
Look, I picked this up for you.

152
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,960
The chance to change your fate

153
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,240
is in your hands now.

154
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,625
If you miss it,

155
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,313
you'll stay ordinary your whole life.

156
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,760
Are you really okay with that?

157
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:11,320
Xia Na,

158
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,040
your new dress is so pretty.

159
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,160
Must be expensive, right?

160
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,160
Is it designer?

161
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,168
Does it really look good?

162
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:18,160
Totally. It really stands out.

163
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,534
It elevates your whole vibe.

164
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:25,120
Xia Na, come here a second.

165
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,310
What?

166
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,840
Are you here to lecture me again?

167
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,320
Xia Na,

168
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,840
- who bought this dress for you?
- What?

169
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:35,880
In your eyes,

170
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:37,360
do I not deserve to wear this?

171
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,800
Xiaotang, what are you doing?

172
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,280
Did you sign with Director Li?

173
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,720
Enough!

174
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,080
Xiaotang, will you stop already?

175
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:50,040
You just can't stand seeing me do well?

176
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:52,160
Wearing a new dress
means I signed a contract

177
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,200
and have gone bad?

178
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,560
Are you jealous of me?

179
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,880
Jealous that I'm prettier than you,

180
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,200
more star material,

181
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,400
and will be more successful?

182
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,472
Xia Na,

183
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,786
I'm not.

184
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,358
Enough.

185
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,805
We stopped being friends long ago.

186
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,800
Stay out of my business.

187
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,529
Xia Na!

188
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:13,840
Why did she leave?

189
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:28,543
Na,

190
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,600
do you like it?

191
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,621
It's the latest style.

192
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:33,898
Just say the word,

193
00:08:34,486 --> 00:08:35,554
and it's yours.

194
00:08:38,237 --> 00:08:39,280
I...

195
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,353
Mr. Li...

196
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:41,960
- Mr. Li.
- Go ahead.

197
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:43,680
Gu Xiaotang said

198
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:48,120
your company makes trainees
entertain clients with drinks.

199
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,160
Is that true?

200
00:08:49,491 --> 00:08:50,960
Don't listen to her nonsense.

201
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,640
She doesn't have what it takes,

202
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:53,920
so she wants to ruin you.

203
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,967
Come on.

204
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,223
Sign here.

205
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,355
The future,

206
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,200
the stage, the spotlight,

207
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:04,000
and millions of fans

208
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,372
will all be yours.

209
00:09:11,208 --> 00:09:14,542
(Model Agency Service Agreement)

210
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,769
Xiaotang,

211
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,560
Xia Na didn't come to school today.

212
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,320
You're her best friend.

213
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:25,880
Can you find her?

214
00:09:37,371 --> 00:09:39,861
(Party B Signature: Gu Xiaotang)

215
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,120
(So)

216
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,920
(all that was meant for me)

217
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,629
(is now happening to Xia Na?)

218
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,440
She signed it anyway.

219
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:58,160
I couldn't talk her out of it.

220
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,380
It's over.

221
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,960
The nightmare

222
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,077
is coming true anyway.

223
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,800
It's okay. We'll figure something out.

224
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,175
It's all my fault.

225
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,760
I gave her the cold shoulder.

226
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:14,760
I pushed her away.

227
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:17,909
Xiaotang,

228
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:20,280
just tell me what's bothering you.

229
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,320
Which blind fool

230
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,000
messed with you this time?

231
00:10:24,503 --> 00:10:25,520
Just say the word.

232
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:26,760
Tomorrow, I'll have the boys

233
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,400
beat him half to death

234
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,526
and make him disappear.

235
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,321
No, Ms. Lei.

236
00:10:31,321 --> 00:10:32,465
Didn't we agree?

237
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,840
We'll stay on the right path

238
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,520
and only make clean money.

239
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:37,440
We can't keep doing this violent,

240
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,520
illegal stuff anymore.

241
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:40,320
Yes. You're totally right.

242
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,240
The right path it is.

243
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,280
Then tell me.

244
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:45,375
How should we get even?

245
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,120
We can't just let that fraud
keep scamming.

246
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,040
To deal with him,

247
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,560
we have to act by law.

248
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,960
Ms. Lei, can you do me another favor?

249
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,000
- Speak.
- I want all the dirt

250
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,840
on how Xingyao
scammed and exploited their trainees.

251
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:05,960
Got it. Leave it to me.

252
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:13,600
Hey. Is your low blood sugar acting up
from not eating all day?

253
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,948
One second.

254
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,412
Here.

255
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:24,880
Hypoglycemia, right?

256
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,430
Xiaotang,

257
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,400
Ye Shen is a pretty good guy.

258
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,499
Yeah, he is.

259
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,840
Never thought

260
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,382
of taking things further?

261
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,200
He already likes someone.

262
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,350
Right?

263
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,895
Fine.

264
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,156
Skip the candy, then.

265
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:15,760
Come on. I'll take you to dinner.

266
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,040
Lu Qingyuan,

267
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,920
are you blind?

268
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,960
You didn't sweep the floor properly.

269
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,345
Pick up the seeds.

270
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:37,400
Didn't Ms. Lei say

271
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,800
we have to listen to Ms. Xiaotang

272
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,040
and stay on the right path?

273
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,960
Picking up seeds isn't wrong, is it?

274
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,840
Here, have some seeds.

275
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,065
Pick them up!

276
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,880
Pick up the seeds!

277
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,470
Eat them!

278
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,680
I told you to pick them up!

279
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:13,910
Pick them up!

280
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,160
(Why?)

281
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:25,520
(Why do I have to crawl here
like a dog?)

282
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:28,080
(How come Gu Xiaotang
only has to say the word)

283
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:32,000
(to make a ruthless boss like Ms. Lei
bow to her,)

284
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,000
(and turn everything into gold?)

285
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:35,873
(Gu Xiaotang,)

286
00:13:35,873 --> 00:13:37,209
(just you wait!)

287
00:13:37,209 --> 00:13:39,280
(I'll never let you get away with this.)

288
00:14:17,672 --> 00:14:21,028
♪The face deep in the heart♪

289
00:14:21,220 --> 00:14:23,682
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

290
00:14:25,057 --> 00:14:28,757
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

291
00:14:28,968 --> 00:14:31,408
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

292
00:14:31,555 --> 00:14:33,927
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

293
00:14:34,077 --> 00:14:36,834
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

294
00:14:36,834 --> 00:14:39,155
♪Even for just a second♪

295
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:43,963
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

296
00:14:44,091 --> 00:14:45,940
♪And sunlight reverses♪

297
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:49,410
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

298
00:14:49,766 --> 00:14:51,840
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

299
00:14:52,342 --> 00:14:55,751
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

300
00:14:56,008 --> 00:15:01,220
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

301
00:15:02,474 --> 00:15:05,039
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

302
00:15:05,081 --> 00:15:08,534
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

303
00:15:09,111 --> 00:15:12,074
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

304
00:15:12,819 --> 00:15:15,427
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

305
00:15:15,427 --> 00:15:19,050
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

306
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:23,576
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
